{"ticker":"SPGI","updated":"2026-11-14T01:26:46Z","profile":{"longName":"S&P Global Inc.","shortName":"S&P Global Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.spglobal.com","fullTimeEmployees":44500,"marketCap":137293742080,"trailingPE":28.29092,"forwardPE":23.473299,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.426548,"pegRatio":1.88,"targetMeanPrice":526.7,"targetHighPrice":572.0,"targetLowPrice":485.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.068,"earningsGrowth":0.101,"grossMargins":0.70994,"operatingMargins":0.44092998,"profitMargins":0.30602,"totalRevenue":16293000192,"beta":1.033,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":522.46924,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":361.03122,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.83},"summary":"S&P Global Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides benchmarks, data, analytics, and workflow solutions in the global capital, energy and commodity, and automotive markets. It operates through four segments: S&P Global Market Intelligence, S&P Global Ratings, S&P Global Energy, and S&P Dow Jones Indices. The S&P Global Market Intelligence segment provides multi-asset-class data and analytics integrated with purpose-built workflow solutions. This segment offers Data, Analytics & Insights, a desktop product suite that provides data, analytics, and third-party research for global finance and corporate professionals; research, reference data, market data, derived analytics, and valuation services; enterprise solutions, such as software and workflow solutions; and credit and risk solutions for selling Ratings' credit ratings and related data and research, analytics, and financial risk solutions. The S&P Global Ratings segment operates as an independent provider of credit ratings, research, and analytics offering investors information and independent benchmarks for their investment and financial decisions as well as access to the capital markets. The S&P Global Energy segment provides information and benchmark prices for the energy and commodity markets. The S&P Dow Jones Indices segment operates as an index provider that maintains various valuation and index benchmarks for inv","summary_zh":"S&P Global Inc. 及其子公司在全球資本、能源和大宗商品以及汽車市場提供基準、數據、分析和工作流程解決方案。它透過四個部門運作：標準普爾全球市場情報部、標準普爾全球評級部、標準普爾全球能源部和標準普爾道瓊斯指數部。標準普爾全球市場情報部門提供與專門建構的工作流程解決方案整合的多元資產類別資料和分析。該部門提供數據、分析和洞察，這是一個桌面產品套件，為全球金融和企業專業人士提供數據、分析和第三方研究；研究、參考資料、市場數據、衍生分析和估值服務；企業解決方案，例如軟體和工作流程解決方案；信用和風險解決方案，用於銷售評級機構的信用評級和相關數據以及研究、分析和財務風險解決方案。標準普爾全球評級部門作為信用評級、研究和分析的獨立提供者運營，為投資者的投資和財務決策以及資本市場准入提供資訊和獨立基準。標準普爾全球能源部門提供能源和商品市場的資訊和基準價格。標準普爾道瓊斯指數部門作為指數提供商運營，維護投資的各種估值和指數基準","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":516.2535,"h":518.3444,"l":513.9357,"c":514.6547,"v":1018737},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":510.8799,"h":513.2072,"l":507.9943,"c":512.1003,"v":1230348},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":514.8155,"h":517.9281,"l":511.3623,"c":514.7587,"v":925615},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":513.491,"h":514.2857,"l":475.9697,"c":480.4163,"v":3421086},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":480.4163,"h":482.4977,"l":475.4778,"c":479.8108,"v":4383802},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":480.9272,"h":486.4144,"l":478.2119,"c":478.3065,"v":1854507},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":478.3349,"h":479.6594,"l":466.4711,"c":469.9716,"v":2377616},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":465.9981,"h":466.8117,"l":459.2715,"c":464.2762,"v":2729280},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":462.9423,"h":464.2384,"l":456.3576,"c":458.789,"v":2043921},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":461.684,"h":464.4844,"l":459.1864,"c":460.9082,"v":1879029},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":465.4305,"h":467.3321,"l":462.0341,"c":464.8439,"v":1961264},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":465.298,"h":465.298,"l":458.1078,"c":460.4636,"v":1718893},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":462.5355,"h":464.1816,"l":454.3519,"c":455.6954,"v":2012739},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":454.1438,"h":458.2403,"l":449.1674,"c":450.9272,"v":1649660},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":449.8865,"h":456.3008,"l":449.1674,"c":453.9357,"v":1424519},{"t":"2025-10-06